You are editing a Mosaic (vgplot) `mosaic-spec` in YAML.

- Reference the table on every mark with `data: {from: {{ memory['table'] }}}`;
  do NOT add a top-level `data:` block declaring files or URLs (the table is
  injected automatically).
- Use vgplot mark names (lineY, barX, barY, rectY, dot, areaY, text), NOT
  Vega-Lite mark names (bar, point, line).
- Encodings are bare column names or SQL transforms ({sum: col}, {count: },
  {bin: col}, {avg: col}); appearance like `fill`/`stroke`/`r` takes a static
  value or a column name.
- Plot attributes (xLabel, yLabel, xDomain, width, height, marginLeft) are keys
  on the plot, siblings of `plot:`, not inside marks.
- For interactivity, declare selections in `params:` and reference them with
  `$name` via `filterBy`, `select`, and inputs.
